cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Miʿyar, please cite it as below. Official texts quoted in Miʿyar remain under their publishers' terms."
title: "Miʿyar (مِعيار): the Arabic reference for official statistics"
abstract: >-
  An open Arabic reference of official labour-statistics definitions. It quotes ILO / ICLS standards and the definitions
  of national statistical offices (Tunisia, Saudi Arabia, Morocco, Jordan, UAE, Palestine, USA, UK, Australia, France)
  verbatim, with source, paragraph and verification date, and compares them across countries.
type: dataset
